-- Tests of l4/laws/interpretation-law.l4 (MMS-689). They sit beside the
-- module and not in it (the client, 2026-10-22).

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `interpretation-law`

§ `בדיקות חוק הפרשנות`

-- §1 and §25(ד) of the Contracts Law: an agreement gets seven sections.
#ASSERT `how the Interpretation Law reaches the instrument` `a contract, as the Interpretation Law meets it` EQUALS `sections 2, 4, 5, 6, 7, 8 and 10, under section 25(ד) of the Contracts Law`
#ASSERT `how the Interpretation Law reaches the instrument` `an administrative instruction given in writing under a law` EQUALS `every section, under section 1`
#ASSERT `how the Interpretation Law reaches the instrument` `an instrument that is neither` EQUALS `not by its own force`
#ASSERT NOT `the Interpretation Law applies to the matter` FALSE TRUE

-- §7: "or other" adds unless a word of likeness stands with it.
#ASSERT NOT `"or" or "other" is likened to the items before it under section 7` FALSE

-- §8: "עד 15:00" in a matter of time includes 15:00.
#ASSERT `section 8 includes the bound "עד" names` TRUE
#ASSERT `the value is within "עד" the bound under section 8` 15 15
#ASSERT NOT `the value is within "עד" the bound under section 8` 15.01 15

-- §10(א): 30 days from day 100 end on day 130.
#ASSERT `the last day of a period of days from a day under section 10(א)` 100 30 EQUALS 130
-- §10(ב): a month after 31 January ends on 28 February; after the 15th, on the 15th.
#ASSERT `the day of the last month a period of months ends on under section 10(ב)` 31 28 EQUALS 28
#ASSERT `the day of the last month a period of months ends on under section 10(ב)` 15 30 EQUALS 15
-- §10(ג): a holiday counts, unless it is the period's last day.
#ASSERT `a day of rest counts in the period under section 10(ג)` FALSE
#ASSERT NOT `a day of rest counts in the period under section 10(ג)` TRUE
